🛑 Applications of Merge Sort in Real Life 🛑

📍Large Database Records: Efficiently sorts large amounts of customer, transaction, or employee data.

📍External Sorting: Used to sort data that is too large to fit into computer memory at once.

📍File Management: Helps organize large collections of files or records based on names, dates, or sizes.

📍Data Analysis: Useful for sorting large datasets before performing further analysis.

📍E-commerce: Can be used to efficiently sort large product datasets by price, rating, or other attributes.
